WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.005
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT ZELENSKY, FIRST
LADY, WELCOME TO THE PROGRAM.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:12.579
MISTER PRESIDENT, IT HAS BEEN
NEARLY NINE MONTHS OF THIS WAR,

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:16.049
NOW DO YOU EXPECT IT TO LAST
THIS, LONG GIVEN A IDEA ABOUT

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:19.452
HOW LONG IT MIGHT LAST?
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR THE.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:22.155
QUESTION AND THANK YOU FOR THE
MONITORING.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:28.761
SHE ASKS WHETHER I THOUGHT THIS
WAR WOULD LAST.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:34.534
NO, I DIDN'T START THIS WAR,
I'M SURE THERE IS NOT A SINGLE

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:38.304
UKRAINIAN WHO KNEW WHAT THIS
WILL BE.

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.907
AND WHAT TRAGEDY THIS WOULD
BRING TO EVERY HOME IN OUR

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:43.910
COUNTRY.
BECAUSE, I REPEAT, WE DID NOT

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:48.915
START THIS WAR.
BUT UKRAINIAN SOCIETY UNITED,

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:53.086
AND SHOWED THAT IT WAS READY
FOR WHAT, UNFORTUNATELY, WAS

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.122
SUCH A TRAGEDY.
SHOWING THAT IT WAS READY FOR

00:00:56.122 --> 00:01:00.560
THESE CHALLENGES.
I WAS REALLY IMPRESSED BY THE

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.596
POWER OF ONE NATION.
AND WAS IMPRESSED BY THE

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.065
SWIFTNESS OF THE RESPONSE OF
EUROPE.

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:09.102
THE WHOLE WORLD.
AND THE WHOLE INTERNATIONAL

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.337
COMMUNITY THAT RALLIED AROUND
UKRAINE.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:15.942
FOR THIS CHALLENGE.
&gt;&gt; FIRST LADY, WHAT MOTIVATED

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:18.978
YOU TO GET UP IN THE MORNING?
HOW DO YOU FEEL THAT YOU HAVE

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:23.016
ENDURED THIS WAR?
&gt;&gt; WELL, THANK.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:25.885
YOU IT IS A BIG QUESTION.
IT COVERS MANY SPHERES OF MY

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.687
LIFE.
AND WHAT HELPS ME GET UP IN THE

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:31.558
MORNING, SHORTLY AS YOU SAID,
IS MY HUSBAND'S EXAMPLE.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:34.928
I KNOW THAT IF HE, ENDURES THAN
I HAVE TO ENDURE.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.997
IF THE DAY HAS BEGUN, THEN WE
HAVE TO KEEP FIGHTING.

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:42.969
THAT KEEPS ME GOING.
IT'S NOT EASY EVERY DAY, BUT

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.738
YOU KNOW YOU NEED TO KEEP
RUNNING.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:48.775
YOU CANNOT STOP.
AS --

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:52.879
SO YOU HAVE TO RUN EVEN FASTER.
THAT IS WHY WE RUN.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:56.082
WE GET SOME INSPIRATION FROM
THE, KIDS FROM THE CHILDREN.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:02:00.053
FIRST AND FOREMOST, THERE ARE
SOME ORDINARY THINGS THAT EVERY

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:04.757
FAMILY IS DOING.
YOU NEED TO GET YOUR SON READY

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:08.127
FOR SCHOOL, NEED TO MAKE SURE
YOUR SOME BREAKFAST.

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:11.698
YOU DON'T HAVE THE INSURANCE
THAT MY CHILD WILL GO TO SCHOOL

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:15.468
EVERY DAY, BECAUSE OF THOSE
STRIKES WITH MISSILES AND

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.704
DRONES.
THERE IS A LOT OF WORK.

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:21.674
A LOT OF HUMAN PROJECTS THAT WE
WILL CONTINUE AFTER THE WAR.

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:28.414
THAT HELPS A LOT.
&gt;&gt; I WANTED TO ASK YOU HOW YOU

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:31.450
REACT.
YOU WILL MONITOR RUSSIAN

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.220
CASUALTIES AND ACTIVITY ON THE
UKRAINIAN BATTLEFIELD.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:39.425
AND THE PENTAGON ACTUALLY IS
VERY INDEFENSIBLY SAT AND I'M

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.761
GOING TO QUOTE TO GET IT RIGHT,
RUSSIA HAS PROBABLY LOST HALF

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:48.635
OF ITS MAIN BATTLE PLANKS, USED
UP MOST OF ITS PRECISION GUIDED

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:52.739
WEAPONS IN THIS WAR, THE 80% OF
THEIR LAND FORCES BOGGED DOWN,

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:56.843
HERE.
IT IS, STOP HERE, AND UKRAINE.

00:02:56.843 --> 00:03:02.615
DOES THAT MATCH YOUR FIGURES,
AND WHAT IS YOUR ANSWER TO THAT?

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:06.786
&gt;&gt; [SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
&gt;&gt; &gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: I THINK THIS

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:07.854
MORE LESS CORRESPONDS TO
REALITY.

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:09.656
ALTHOUGH, FRANKLY.
SPEAKING NOBODY KNOWS THE FULL

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:11.457
REALITY.
ESPECIALLY AS REGARDS

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:14.794
PERSONNEL.
NOBODY CAN TELL YOU PRECISELY

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:18.765
HOW MANY PEOPLE DIED.
NEVERTHELESS, WE UNDERSTAND

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:23.002
THAT THE ARTILLERY THAT WAS
PROVIDED HAS ASSISTANCE TO US

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.103
FOR THE UNITED STATES AND
EUROPE.

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:30.610
DEFINITELY HAD TO BREAK THIS
INITIATIVE WHICH RUSSIAN

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:34.447
LAUNCHED ON THE 24TH OF
FEBRUARY.

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:36.983
--
THIS MILITARY INITIATIVE, WHICH

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:39.085
STOP.
THEN OCCUPIED A LARGE PART OF

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:42.322
THE TERRITORY.
AND, THIS INDEED, WAS HELPED BY

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:44.057
THE ARTILLERY.
AND THE NEW TECHNOLOGIES.

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:48.027
WE NEVER RESORTED TO ANY OF THE
LINES THAT THE RUSSIAN

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:51.931
FEDERATION PRODUCES, LIKE BONDS
OR NUCLEAR CHALLENGES AND SO

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:55.034
ON.
I AM VERY PLEASED THAT WE ARE

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:58.204
WORKING JOINTLY.
AND RESPONDING QUICKLY TO THAT.

00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:03.910
STRAIGHT AFTER RUSSIA'S
ALLEGATIONS WE INVITED THE IEA.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:08.147
AND THEY VERIFIED EVERYTHING
AND SAID IT IS JUST ANOTHER LIE

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:11.951
FROM RUSSIA.
SO I CANNOT CONFIRM FOR SURE,

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:16.622
BUT I CAN SAY FOR SURE THAT IT
IS A STUNNING NUMBER BOTH IN

00:04:16.622 --> 00:04:19.459
TERMS OF HEAVY WEAPONS AND
PERSONNEL.

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:22.061
&gt;&gt; THEIR LOSS IS HEAVIER THAN
YOUR LOSSES?

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:25.998
&gt;&gt; YES.
TEN TIMES.

00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:28.768
I THINK, SO APPROXIMATELY.
I CAN'T GIVE YOU THE EXACT

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:31.771
NUMBERS.
IT IS A VERY SIGNIFICANT

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:34.974
DIFFERENCE.
OUR WAR TACTIC IS NOT TO THROW

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:37.643
PEOPLE.
BECAUSE PEOPLE ARE MOST

00:04:37.643 --> 00:04:39.612
IMPORTANT.
NOT USING PEOPLE AS CANNON

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:41.981
FODDER.
THAT IS WHY IT IS VERY

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:45.118
IMPORTANT TO US.
WHENEVER WE ASKED OUR PARTNERS

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:49.121
FOR ARTILLERY OR ARMORED
VEHICLES, THAT IT IS NOT JUST

00:04:49.121 --> 00:04:52.792
ABOUT THE WEAPONS BUT FIRST OF
ALL PROTECTION FOR OUR

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:56.095
MILITARY.
&gt;&gt; MADAM FIRST LADY, YOU JUST

00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:58.264
RETURNED FROM A MAJOR TECH
CONFERENCE.

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:01.634
I THINK THE WORLD HAS NOTED
THAT UKRAINE HAS USED

00:05:01.634 --> 00:05:04.170
TECHNOLOGY IN A REALLY
INNOVATIVE AN EFFECTIVE WAY.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:07.673
WHAT WAS YOUR MESSAGE THERE AND
WHAT YOU WANT THE TEMPORAL TO

00:05:07.673 --> 00:05:14.313
DO FOR THIS COUNTRY?
&gt;&gt; [SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:05:14.313 --> 00:05:16.115
&gt;&gt; &gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: MY MESSAGE
WAS PRETTY SIMPLE I HOPE IT WAS

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:18.684
A HERD.
PEOPLE GATHERED THERE WERE

00:05:18.684 --> 00:05:20.019
PEOPLE --
TO FALL.

00:05:20.019 --> 00:05:22.088
THESE PEOPLE HAVE AN IMPACT ON
WHICH DIRECTION TECHNOLOGY IN

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:24.323
THE WHOLE WORLD WILL MOVE IN
THE FUTURE.

00:05:24.323 --> 00:05:29.195
MY APPEAL TO THEM IS TO CHOOSE
A SIDE.

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:32.064
WHAT TECHNOLOGY THEY WILL
INVENT OR DESIGN.

00:05:32.064 --> 00:05:36.202
WILL THIS BE A TECHNOLOGY THAT
KILLS, OR IN TECHNOLOGY THAT

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:39.739
DEFENDS?
BECAUSE WE HAVE A WONDERFUL

00:05:39.739 --> 00:05:43.709
EXAMPLE, FOR EXAMPLE --
RECENTLY CONDUCTED THEIR LATEST

00:05:43.709 --> 00:05:46.345
INVESTIGATION.
AND THEY FOUND THAT THE GROUP

00:05:46.345 --> 00:05:50.750
OF I.T. EXPERTS FROM RUSSIA,
YOUNG PEOPLE AGED 20 3:25,

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:54.420
BEFORE THE WAR THEY WORKED IN
PRIVATE 90 COMPANIES.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:57.390
NOW THEY ARE TARGETING MISSILES
AND BUILDINGS.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:00.760
THIS IS A CHOICE.
A CONSCIOUS CHOICE MADE BY

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.996
PEOPLE WHO KNOW THIS TECHNOLOGY,
WHO HAVE THE EXPERTISE.

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:08.701
NARROW SPECIALISTS.
THEY CHOSE TO BE MURDERERS AND

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:11.003
TERRORISTS.
MY APPEAL TO ALL THOSE

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:14.707
THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE GATHERED AT
THE SUMMIT WAS TO MAKE THE

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:17.243
CHOICE FROM A MORAL AND ETHICAL
STANDPOINT.

00:06:17.243 --> 00:06:20.246
AS TO WHAT THEY WILL DO IN THE
FUTURE.

00:06:20.246 --> 00:06:23.616
AND, REALLY THESE ANALOGIES
HELP.

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:29.689
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS THE STATUS OF
KHERSON AND THE IMPENDING

00:06:29.689 --> 00:06:35.161
BATTLE TO RETAKE KHERSON?
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: THERE IS A VERY

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:37.096
SERIOUS QUESTION.
AND I WILL BE FRANK WITH.

00:06:37.096 --> 00:06:39.365
YOU I WILL TRY TO ANSWER IT IN
THE WAY THAT DOES NOT GIVE YOU

00:06:39.365 --> 00:06:43.869
AN ANSWER, TO BE HONEST.
BECAUSE THESE PLANNED MILITARY

00:06:43.869 --> 00:06:47.073
ACTIONS, THEY ARE DISCUSSED IN
A SMALL CIRCLE.

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:50.142
BUT THEN THEY ARE EXECUTED IN
SILENCE.

00:06:50.142 --> 00:06:53.246
AND I REALLY WANT TO HAVE --
I DON'T WANT TO HAVE AN

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:55.281
UNPLEASANT SURPRISE FOR THE,
ENEMY AND NOT SOMETHING THEY

00:06:55.281 --> 00:06:56.883
ARE PREPARED.
FOR SO I WOULD LIKE TO

00:06:56.883 --> 00:07:01.053
APOLOGIZE.
BUT AT ANY RATE, OUR PEOPLE AND

00:07:01.053 --> 00:07:04.757
YOUR PUBLIC NEEDS TO KNOW THAT
WE ARE WORKING ON SOME VERY

00:07:04.757 --> 00:07:07.760
SERIOUS STEPS, WITH A POSITIVE
OUTCOME FOR THE CITIZENS OF

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:10.129
UKRAINE.
AND FOR ALL THOSE COMMUNITIES

00:07:10.129 --> 00:07:15.134
THAT SUPPORT PEACE AND UKRAINE.
&gt;&gt; THE RUSSIANS ARE OBSERVED AS

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:18.304
DIGGING IN THE VERY VERY HARD,
SOME 3 TO 4 LAYERS.

00:07:18.304 --> 00:07:20.172
ALL THE WAY DOWN TO THE SOUTH,
TO THE PORT.

00:07:20.172 --> 00:07:25.177
TO THE SEA.
DO YOU BELIEVE THAT THEY ARE

00:07:25.177 --> 00:07:29.048
MOUNTING A MORE SERIOUS DEFENSE
OF KHERSON THEN PERHAPS THE

00:07:29.048 --> 00:07:32.952
OTHER AREAS THAT YOU HAVE
LIBERATED?

00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:35.388
&gt;&gt; &gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: THAT IS
RIGHT.

00:07:35.388 --> 00:07:37.656
THEY WERE VERY POWERFUL
DEFENSE.

00:07:37.656 --> 00:07:40.459
AND NOT WHAT WE MEAN ABOUT THE
MILITARY HEADQUARTERS, WE MET

00:07:40.459 --> 00:07:42.895
AND AT FIRST WE CANNOT BELIEVE
THAT THEY WOULD BE RUNNING AWAY

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:45.898
FROM HOUSE ON.
I BELIEVE THAT THIS WAR IS JUST

00:07:45.898 --> 00:07:50.069
AN ATTEMPT TO DRAW MORE
UKRAINIAN TROOPS IN THAT

00:07:50.069 --> 00:07:51.437
DIRECTION.
&gt;&gt; WE'VE HEARD OF MANY

00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:53.572
UKRAINIAN CHILDREN BEING TAKEN
OVER TO RUSSIA.

00:07:53.572 --> 00:07:55.741
WE DO NOT, NOW IT REALLY, WHAT
IS HAPPENING.

00:07:55.741 --> 00:07:59.445
HERE IN KYIV AND IN THE AREA.
I HAVE MET AND WATCHED OVER THE

00:07:59.445 --> 00:08:02.081
LAST FEW DAYS.
GOOD TO HAVE OBVIOUSLY BEEN

00:08:02.081 --> 00:08:05.618
TRAUMATIZED BY THE WAR, AERATE
SIREN, FRIGHTENING LITTLE ONES.

00:08:05.618 --> 00:08:07.520
KIDS WHO HAVE BEEN TOLD TO BE
QUIET AND HIDE QUIETLY.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.823
I'M DIFFICULTY SPEAKING AND
COMMUNICATING.

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:15.361
SOME KIDS HAVE SEEN HORRIBLE
THINGS HAPPEN UNDER OCCUPATION.

00:08:15.361 --> 00:08:17.763
THEIR MOTHERS, RAPED FOR
INSTANCE.

00:08:17.763 --> 00:08:20.466
OBVIOUSLY YOU ARE A MOTHER, BUT
YOU ARE VERY INVOLVED IN THE

00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:23.369
MENTAL HEALTH ASPECT.
AND WITH YOUR FOUNDATION AS,

00:08:23.369 --> 00:08:28.574
WELL WITH WOMEN AND CHILDREN.
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: FIRST OF ALL IT

00:08:28.574 --> 00:08:30.343
IS A BIG TRAGEDY THAT OUR
CHILDREN ARE BEING TAKEN AWAY

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:32.078
TO RUSSIA.
THERE IS A LARGE NUMBER OF

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:35.314
CHILDREN WHO ARE SOCIAL
SERVICES LOST CONNECTION WITH,

00:08:35.314 --> 00:08:40.419
SO WE CANNOT FIND THEM.
SOMETHING THE, SUMMER RUSSIANS

00:08:40.419 --> 00:08:41.621
RELAX THEIR ADOPTION
LEGISLATION.

00:08:41.621 --> 00:08:46.058
THEY SIMPLIFIED THE PROCEDURE
TO ADOPT UKRAINIAN CHILDREN,

00:08:46.058 --> 00:08:48.728
WHICH IS HORRIBLE.
AND WE UNDERSTAND WE WILL HAVE

00:08:48.728 --> 00:08:51.397
TO FIGHT FOR THEM.
AND WE KEEP TALKING ABOUT IT AT

00:08:51.397 --> 00:08:54.567
ALL INTERNATIONAL FORUMS.
CURRENTLY, WE HAVE AN AGREEMENT

00:08:54.567 --> 00:08:58.037
ON THE EVACUATION OF TWO
CHILDREN'S HOMES FROM THE

00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:00.673
ODESSA REGION.
AND THIS IS ALREADY AN

00:09:00.673 --> 00:09:06.912
AGREEMENT REACHED WITH TURKEY.
WE ARE TRYING TO SAVE THEM IN

00:09:06.912 --> 00:09:08.881
ADVANCE.
BUT JUST TWO DAYS AGO, I HAD

00:09:08.881 --> 00:09:11.217
NEWS THAT A CHILDREN'S HOME AS
WE MOVE FROM THE OCCUPIED

00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:13.419
TERRITORIES IN THE KHERSON
REGION.

00:09:13.419 --> 00:09:14.920
WE CANNOT REACH, THEM
UNFORTUNATELY.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:18.658
WE CANNOT SAVE THEM.
BUT HOPEFULLY THE INTERNATIONAL

00:09:18.658 --> 00:09:20.059
COMMUNITY WILL HELP US RETURN
OUR CHILDREN.

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:25.097
NOW, AS REGARDS HELPING THOSE
CHILDREN WHO SUFFER

00:09:25.097 --> 00:09:27.767
PSYCHOLOGICALLY FROM THE
HORRORS OF WAR, NOW THERE ARE

00:09:27.767 --> 00:09:28.868
HUNDREDS OF THESE CHILDREN
ALREADY.

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:31.871
WE CANNOT EVEN IMAGINE WHAT
THOSE CHILDREN SUFFERED.

00:09:31.871 --> 00:09:36.542
WHO HAD TO BURY THEIR OWN
MOTHER IN THE HEARTS OF THEIR

00:09:36.542 --> 00:09:38.978
HOME.
OR SAW THEIR RELATIVES

00:09:38.978 --> 00:09:41.514
MURDERED.
WHO STAYED IN THE BASEMENT OF

00:09:41.514 --> 00:09:43.482
MARIUPOL.
WE CAN ONLY OBSERVE THEM A TRY

00:09:43.482 --> 00:09:46.952
TO HELP.
AND FOR THAT PURPOSE, WE ARE

00:09:46.952 --> 00:09:51.023
ESTABLISHING A NATIONAL PROGRAM
ON MENTAL HEALTH AND

00:09:51.023 --> 00:09:55.027
PSYCHOSOCIAL SUPPORTS.
WHICH I HOPE WILL HAVE A LOT OF

00:09:55.027 --> 00:09:58.397
PROJECTS.
I CAN GIVE YOU AN EXAMPLE.

00:09:58.397 --> 00:10:01.500
, ONCE FAIRLY SUCCESSFUL I
BELIEVE, WELL ORGANIZED THE

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.370
COUNTS TOGETHER WITH UKRAINIAN
PSYCHOLOGIST AND DONORS.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:08.440
THERE WERE 20 KIDS WITH
PSYCHOLOGICAL ISSUES.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:12.078
WE TOOK THEM TO A SPECIAL CAMP
WHERE THE SHOOTERS WERE

00:10:12.078 --> 00:10:15.280
PSYCHOLOGISTS.
WE SPENT 20 DAYS IN SPAIN UNDER

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:17.616
CONSTANT 24-HOUR PSYCHOLOGICAL
MONITORING.

00:10:17.616 --> 00:10:20.619
AND THIS THERAPY HAD WONDERFUL
RESULTS.

00:10:20.619 --> 00:10:24.423
THE CHILDREN WHO DID NOT SPEAK
STARTED SPEAKING, THE CHILDREN

00:10:24.423 --> 00:10:28.427
WHO AREN'T EATING DISORDERS OR
DIDN'T EAT AT ALL, THERE WAS

00:10:28.427 --> 00:10:31.097
ONE WHO NEVER SLEPT.
THE TEACHERS HAD TO SLEEP

00:10:31.097 --> 00:10:33.232
BESIDE THEM, BECAUSE YOU CAN
ONLY SPEAK IF THERE WERE

00:10:33.232 --> 00:10:35.501
SOMEBODY NEXT TO HIM.
AND, INDEED WE SAW WONDERFUL

00:10:35.501 --> 00:10:37.036
RESULTS.
WE WANT TO SCALE UP THIS

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:38.871
PROJECT.
WE ARE SUPPORTED BY EXPERTS

00:10:38.871 --> 00:10:42.308
FROM ISRAEL AND BELGIUM.
THE NEXT TRAINING DESTINATION

00:10:42.308 --> 00:10:43.976
FOR OUR SPECIALIST WILL BE IN
THE UK.

00:10:43.976 --> 00:10:47.713
VERY SOON THIS MONTH WE WILL BE
SENDING A PSYCHOLOGIST AND

00:10:47.713 --> 00:10:51.283
PSYCHOTHERAPIST FOR TRAINING
THERE.

00:10:51.283 --> 00:10:55.187
WHICH IS THE WORLD'S BEST
PRACTICES EVER COPING WITH

00:10:55.187 --> 00:10:55.687
PTSD.

